        "minimax_h3_prompt_reference_doc": {
          "version": 1,
          "text": "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\r\n\r\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Pixel animation, a medium-wide shot shows the elderly farmer from <Picture 1> — straw hat, gray mustache and beard, blue plaid shirt with rolled sleeves, brown work gloves, dirt-stained blue jeans, and green rubber boots — standing at the head of a sunlit vegetable field with neat crop rows, a wooden fence, and a small red barn in the distance, holding his wicker basket of red and yellow peppers. He steps forward, sets the basket down between the rows, and kneels on one knee, his gloved hands snapping ripe peppers from their stems and dropping them one by one into the basket. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward his steady working hands.\r\n\r\noverall_soundscape: Morning birds chirp over a light wind moving through the crop rows. Leaves rustle, peppers snap off their stems, and each one lands in the wicker basket with a soft hollow thump.\r\n\r\nnon_diegetic_music: A bright chiptune melody at a moderate tempo, built from simple square-wave notes over a light percussion pulse, holding a steady level throughout.\r\n\r\nFor the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\r\n\r\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Pixel animation, a wide shot shows the elderly farmer from <Picture 1> — straw hat, gray mustache and beard, blue plaid shirt with rolled sleeves, brown work gloves, dirt-stained blue jeans, and green rubber boots — standing upright at the edge of a sunlit vegetable field, holding his wicker basket heaped full with red and yellow peppers. He starts walking along the dirt path between the crop rows, the basket swaying gently with each step, while the camera pulls out with small amplitude at slow speed to reveal the wooden fence and the small red barn ahead. Toward the end he slows to a stop just short of the barn door and settles into a still pose with the full basket in his grip.\r\n\r\noverall_soundscape: Wind sweeps across the open field while distant birds call. Rubber boots press into the dirt path with steady crunching steps, and the packed basket creaks softly with each stride.\r\n\r\nnon_diegetic_music: A bright chiptune melody at a moderate tempo with simple square-wave notes and a light bass line, resolving on a held final note as the farmer stops at the barn.",
